DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45135::$$$message_0406_0000_0000$$$::"You've finally pinned down the culprit, Kayneth."::
45136::$$$message_0406_0000_0001$$$::"Einzbern... Kiritsugu Emiya... I'll never forgive you! Enough with the hanafuda! It's the death penalty[line len=2]"::
45137::$$$message_0406_0000_0002$$$::"Kayneth. You didn't come to Fuyuki for revenge, did you?"::
45138::$$$message_0406_0000_0003$$$::"Shouldn't you focus more on yourself? Try managing your stress, improving your circulation with massages, or eating seaweed."::
45139::$$$message_0406_0000_0004$$$::"Seaweed? Wait, hold on. Why am I here, anyway?"::
45140::$$$message_0406_0000_0005$$$::"Lady Sola-Ui. Perhaps you should stop there."::
45141::$$$message_0406_0000_0006$$$::"Any more would be an affront to my lord. As his knight, I will brook no further insults."::
45142::$$$message_0406_0000_0007$$$::"Oh, I didn't mean to..."::
45143::$$$message_0406_0000_0008$$$::"My lord has chosen the most [font italic=true]barren and austere[font italic=false] path, in pursuit of fortune and glory."::
45144::$$$message_0406_0000_0009$$$::"I'm sorry... I shouldn't have said that, Kayneth. You're just fine the way you are."::
45145::$$$message_0406_0000_0010$$$::"You two are really mean, you know that?"::

